Title: Client Credential flow - Client app authorization

participant Client
participant Authorization Server

Note right of Client: A service/worker
Client->Authorization Server: Exchange token
Note right of Client: <credentials> is the base64 encoded\nof <client_id>:<client_secret>
Note right of Client: POST /o/token/\nHeader:\nAuthorization: Basic <credentials>\nData:\n- grant_type: client_credentials\n
Authorization Server-->Client: Access token
Note right of Client: Store access token
